cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: nwb-inspect
abstract: 'Validates NWB files and summarises their contents: PyNWB schema validation against the namespaces cached
  in each file, NWB Inspector best-practice checks (DANDI configuration by default), DANDI upload readiness checked
  offline with the dandi library (required subject fields, metadata, dandi organize file names), a content summary
  (subject, devices, probes, units, ophys, pose, intervals, extensions, storage) and small previews; writes report.json,
  report.pdf and issues.csv. Part of the Pennsieve systems neuroscience workflows.'
